abstract: >
  Statistical processing and diagramming for the University of Utah immersive virtual reality feasibility study in the ICU
  (JMIR Serious Games, 2024). Contains Stata scripts for pre/post analyses of mood, anxiety and pain, and a Quarto document
  that renders the enrollment flow diagram. De-identified data are available upon IRB-approved request, as described in the paper.
